12 3.5z\"/><path d=\"M9.6 14.2a2.6 2.6 0 0 0 2.3 2.5\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>21% fragrance concentration</h3>\n        <p>Made to be noticed all day.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-trust-item\">\n        <div class=\"ts-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3.5 19 6v5.4c0 4.4-2.9 7.7-7 9.1-4.1-1.4-7-4.7-7-9.1V6z\"/><path d=\"m9 11.9 2.2 2.2 3.8-4.2\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>60-day guarantee</h3>\n        <p>Try the perfume at home. If it's not right for you, you have 60 days to return it.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-trust-item\">\n        <div class=\"ts-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.5\"/><path d=\"M12 7.5V12l3 2\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Long-lasting scent</h3>\n        <p>Made to stay noticeable for up to 12 hours.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
